## F1. Phase 1 — Task List

  ⬜  P1-01  Project scaffold (Next.js 14, TypeScript, Tailwind, Zustand)
  ⬜  P1-02  next.config.ts  (WP image domains, env vars)
  ⬜  P1-03  Root layout — src/app/layout.tsx (Header + Footer wired)
  ⬜  P1-04  Header component (nav from WP Menu, cart icon with live count)
  ⬜  P1-05  Footer component (links/content from WP)
  ⬜  P1-06  WooCommerce REST client — src/lib/woocommerce.ts
  ⬜  P1-07  WooCommerce Store API client — src/lib/storeApi.ts
  ⬜  P1-08  Product types — src/types/product.ts
  ⬜  P1-09  Homepage — src/app/page.tsx + featured/bestseller sections
  ⬜  P1-10  Shop/Category page — src/app/shop/page.tsx + src/app/shop/[category]/page.tsx
             + ProductGrid + ProductCard + CategoryFilter
  ⬜  P1-11  Product detail page — src/app/product/[slug]/page.tsx
             (images, price, variations if variable/subscription product, description)
  ⬜  P1-12  Zustand cart store — src/store/cart.ts (mirrors Store API cart)
  ⬜  P1-13  Cart page — src/app/cart/page.tsx (line items, qty update, remove, totals)
  ⬜  P1-14  loading.tsx + Skeletons for every route above (Section I)
  ⬜  P1-15  End-to-end smoke test: browse shop → open product → add to cart →
             view cart with correct totals (no checkout submission — see 0.1)

## F2. Phase 1 — Plugins/data relevant to each page

  HEADER / FOOTER (src/app/layout.tsx)
  ─────────────────────────────────────
  - WP REST menus          → nav links
  - WooCommerce Store API  → live cart item count badge

  HOMEPAGE (src/app/page.tsx)
  ─────────────────────────────
  - WooCommerce REST API   → featured/bestseller product list
  - WP REST API            → any homepage content from a WP page (if used)

  SHOP / CATEGORY PAGE (src/app/shop/page.tsx, src/app/shop/[category]/page.tsx)
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  - WooCommerce REST API   → product list, categories, pagination
  - CURCY (multi-currency) → price already converted server-side, just render it
  - WooCommerce Wholesale Prices → ignore in Phase 1 (guest pricing only, see A4)

  PRODUCT DETAIL PAGE (src/app/product/[slug]/page.tsx)
  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  - WooCommerce REST API         → product data, variations, images, description
  - WooCommerce Subscriptions    → render "subscribe to save X%" option if product
                                    type is a subscription (data comes pre-calculated)
  - WooCommerce Min/Max Quantities → respect min/max values returned by the API in
                                    the quantity input, don't invent limits
  - Advanced Product Labels (BeRocket) → render label/badge data if present on product
  - Product Video Gallery         → render video if product meta includes one

  CART PAGE (src/app/cart/page.tsx)
  ─────────────────────────────────
  - WooCommerce Store API  → cart lines, quantities, totals (source of truth)
  - Zustand store          → local mirror for instant UI updates only

## F3. Phase 1 — NOT included (see Section E2 for the full deferred list)

  Checkout, account/auth, reviews widget, popups, chat, contact form,
  appointment booking, SEO polish. These start only after Phase 1 is approved.

## F4. Phase 1 — Confirm before starting (blockers to resolve first)

  □  WC REST API keys generated (Consumer Key + Secret, read-only scope)
  □  Confirm WooCommerce Store API is reachable (wp-json/wc/store/v1/cart returns 200)
  □  Confirm which WP Menu location maps to the header nav (avia / avia2 / avia_alternate)
  □  Design tokens measured from the live site (Section G0) before first component is styled
  □  Decide hosting target for Next.js (affects env var setup in H2)

